ury are  back to the office at the moment yeah  well we're making good progress i was  actually just hosting coffee with a  bunch of recent graduates who've joined  the treasury over the last six to 12  months and all of them are excited to  slowly and carefully be coming back to  the office and that's very much the  government's guidance you know we're no  longer instructing people to work from  home and it will be up to employees and  employers to make those decisions for  themselves and what we expect is a  cautious and gradual return to the  office
 

